  "description": "Work is done, fun begins. Meet the Rossignol After Hours Eagle 90 e-MTB, your all-access pass to flowy trails, good times, and unforgettable sunsets.\n\nFrom smooth climbs to fluid descents, the Bosch Performance Line CX motor and our tailor-made aluminum frame deliver responsive power and an intuitive ride that keeps you in the flow. The four-bar linkage design with Marzocchi Bomber shocks offers 150 mm of rear travel and 160 mm up front for confident control and agile handling in rough terrain.\n\nThe SRAM Eagle 90 drivetrain and heavy-duty SRAM Maven Base brakes keep your gearing and speed in check.\n\nClock out, and turn up the fun.\n\nUncompromising Power and Range\nDominate every ascent with the Bosch Performance Line CX motor, providing class-leading torque and fluid assistance. Paired with the high-capacity 800Wh PowerTube battery, you have the range to explore further and climb higher without ever glancing at the battery gauge\n\nIntelligent Ride Tracking\nStay connected with the Bosch Kiox 400C display. This compact, vibrant interface provides real-time ride data, navigation, and seamless integration with the Bosch ecosystem, all while staying protected on the cockpit\n\nRugged Suspension Performance\nThe Marzocchi Bomber Z1 fork sets the standard for reliable, plush performance with 160 mm of travel, while the Marzocchi Bomber Air rear shock provides 150 mm of travel to deliver consistent traction and a supportive feel on long, grueling descents\n\nNext-Gen Eagle 90 T-Type Shifting\nShift with confidence under full power. Featuring a robust hangerless interface, the SRAM Eagle S-90 T-Type ensures precise, reliable gear changes and exceptional impact resistance for total trail durability\n\nMassive Braking Power and Control\nSRAM Maven Base four-piston hydraulic brakes paired with 220/200 mm rotors offer monumental stopping power. Specifically designed for the higher speeds and weights of modern e-MTBs, they provide the modulation and thermal management needed for total control on any terrain\n\nDurable, Trail-Ready Wheelset\nThe RaceFace AR Offset 30 wheels are engineered for strength and stability. Built to withstand the rigors of aggressive trail riding and the extra torque of an e-bike, they offer a reliable and stiff platform for maximum confidence",
